s</b>(\u0d9c\u0dbd\u0dca\u0db6\u0ddc\u0da9 \u0d87\u0dbd\u0dca\u0dbd) is a waterfall in Sri Lanka. It is located by Nuwara Eliya District. Galboda is along the railway track of Colombo to Badulla. The environment is cool with much rain.</p>"}